BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Buddhist Ritual: Sevenfold Puja
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261024T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261024T153000
UID:88c4fd0f587e645fac0a1862@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Ritual (‘Puja’ in Sanskrit) is an aspect of Buddhist pract
 ice which helps us orientate our minds towards our deepest ideals. A typic
 al Buddhist ritual involves reciting verses of poetry\, chanting a mantra
 \, and making offerings of candles and incense. \n\nAll are welcome to joi
 n in\, whether or not you’ve taken part in a Buddhist ritual before.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/buddhist-ritual-sevenfol
 d-puja-24-oct-2026
END:VEVENT
